  "outlook": "Outlook for the First Quarter Fiscal 2027: The Company expects net sales to be approximately $500.0 million to $510.0 million in the first quarter of fiscal 2027, compared to $436.0 million in the prior year, for a growth rate of 14.7% to 17.0%. Excluding $28.0 million of expected net sales from VACCO, net sales are expected to grow 8.3% to 10.6%. Adjusted gross margin is expected to be in the range of 45.25% to 45.5% and SG&A as a percentage of net sales is expected to be in the range of 16.50% to 16.75%."
